
# 📄 MVP SPECIFICATION (UPDATED)

## AI Speaking Club (Telegram MVP)

---

# 1. Product Overview

**AI Speaking Club** — Telegram-based English speaking practice platform where users:

* join small group conversations in Telegram voice chats
* receive AI-generated feedback after speaking sessions

